      "short": "Zoe: \\$23.90/h; \\$1529.60 per fortnight.\n\nChloe: 38 hours per week; \\$1086.80 per week.\n\nJoey: \\$813.96 per week; \\$1627.92 per fortnight.\n\nBowie: \\$32.55/h; \\$911.40 per week.",
      "worked": "Zoe\n$$\\begin{align*}\\text{Hourly wage}&=\\frac{764.80}{32}\\\\&=\\$23.90/\\text{h}\\\\\\text{Fortnightly wage}&=764.80\\times2\\\\&=\\$1529.60\\end{align*}$$\nChloe\n$$\\begin{align*}\\text{Weekly wage}&=\\frac{2173.60}{2}\\\\&=\\$1086.80\\\\\\text{Weekly hours}&=\\frac{1086.80}{28.60}\\\\&=38\\text{ hours}\\end{align*}$$\nJoey\n$$\\begin{align*}\\text{Weekly wage}&=21.42\\times38\\\\&=\\$813.96\\\\\\text{Fortnightly wage}&=813.96\\times2\\\\&=\\$1627.92\\end{align*}$$\nBowie\n$$\\begin{align*}\\text{Weekly wage}&=\\frac{1822.80}{2}\\\\&=\\$911.40\\\\\\text{Hourly wage}&=\\frac{911.40}{28}\\\\&=\\$32.55/\\text{h}\\end{align*}$$",
